  "design_notes": [
    "Five fragment categories per task share the header position, the frame 'Operators also confirmed that', a 10-word body and a 6-word trailing sentence (25 words).",
    "NEUTRAL is the preserved neutral-prose control (replicate 0) from the earlier experiments, identical for every task; it has no reporting frame.",
    "TOPIC_NO_EVIDENCE and OFF_TOPIC share one filler word; MATCHING_ID replaces the filler by 'ticket TASK-n' where n is the number of the policy identifier in the question.",
    "Token counts are within 0-2 Qwen tokens (0-1 Llama tokens) inside each task; see token_match. Neutral differs most (a different structure); mismatches are recorded, not hidden.",
    "Answer A is fixed by the written rule in the question plus the authorized evidence, independent of any model output."
  ]
